CHAPTER.VERS:
And Rebbe Melech HaMoshiach said to them, "Who among you will have a chaver and will come to him at chatzot halailah 

          midnight
        , and say to him,  `Chaver, lend me shalosh kikrot;

"When a Gibbor
Strong Man , fully armed, is shomer over his armon
palace , his possessions are left in shalom;
